  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2400,
      "text": "He said, “Its knowledge is with my Lord in a Record. My Lord never errs, nor does He forget.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2401,
      "text": "It is He Who spread out the earth for you and made therein pathways for you, and sent down rain from the sky; and We brought forth thereby various types of plants.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2402,
      "text": "Eat and graze your livestock. Indeed, there are signs in this for people of sound intellect.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2403,
      "text": "From this [earth] We created you, and to it We will return you, and from it We will raise you once again.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2404,
      "text": "We showed Pharaoh all Our signs, but he rejected them and refused to believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2405,
      "text": "He said, “Have you come to drive us out of our land with your magic, O Moses?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2406,
      "text": "We will surely bring you similar magic. So appoint a day between us that neither you nor we will fail to keep, in a convenient place[13].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2407,
      "text": "Moses said, “Your appointment is the festival day[14]; let the people be gathered at forenoon[15].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2408,
      "text": "So Pharaoh went away and put together his scheme, then came forth.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2409,
      "text": "Moses said to them, “Woe to you, do not fabricate lies against Allah[16], lest He exterminate you with a punishment. Those who fabricate lies are bound to fail.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2410,
      "text": "Then they disputed the matter among themselves and kept their talk private.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2411,
      "text": "They said, “These two are merely magicians who want to drive you out of your land with their magic and destroy your exemplary way of life.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 315,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2412,
      "text": "So gather your scheme, then line up in a row. Whoever prevails today is indeed the victor.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
